    Eating rotten things is never a good idea. Drinking salt water might
help, although I've never tried it myself. But the Right Answer in this
case is one of:

    (1) Get some patience.
    (2) Get a tinning kit so you won't need patience.
    (3) Kill one dragon at a time, so the others stay fresh while you're 
eating the first one. How to lure a dragon away from the herd is left as
an exercise for the reader.
    (4) Get magical breathing --- but then, even if you don't choke, isn't 
there a limit to how much you can eat at one sitting? I'm not sure.
    (5) Polymorphing into a purple worm probably doesn't help with 
intrinsics, does it?

